 Stored DTMF codes and touch tone decoding are not built yet.
+
+### M17 bench image
+
+Only the dedicated experimental M17 PTT test build uses this gesture. After bench setup, select an idle FM VFO with equal receive and transmit frequencies and scanning off. Hold the physical monitor key, then press PTT while continuing to hold monitor. The TX indication accompanies one short data burst. Release either key to stop early. Release PTT before another attempt. The test uses the existing VFO and TX screen.
